{"title": "Pixelated 127: Nobody reads, nobody writes", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/27/pixelated-127-nobody-reads-nobody-writes/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2024/03/Pixelated-cover.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Welcome to Pixelated episode 127. This week, we’re unlocking a bonus episode from the vault. Originally recorded in the aftermath of the Pixel 11 launch and review cycle, listen in as Abner, Damien, and Will discuss how they stay motivated to continue reporting on and reviewing technology products, the state of criticism on the internet in 2026, and the joys of just appreciating what you like regardless of other people’s opinions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Enjoy the show? You can listen to our weekly members-only Pixelated Pro bonus episode by <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/pro/\">signing up for 9to5Google Pro</a> for just $5 per month, or about $1 per episode.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Sponsored by Proton Unlimited</strong>: Pixelated listeners can save 30% on an annual subscription to the company’s suite of privacy-friendly services by <a href=\"https://proton.me/9to5google\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">signing up using our link</a>. Thanks to Proton Unlimited for sponsoring the podcast.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls=\"controls\" src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/pix-free-nobody-reads.mp3\"></audio></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-subscribe\">Subscribe</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLcKP282Ii48tKK_KUt1kq1Ist9FkYR6lO\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube Podcasts</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://pca.st/podcast/ac8e6ce0-06b1-0136-c264-7d73a919276a\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Pocket Cast